  <media:group>
   <media:title>Subaru Forester/Hybrid | How-To Set Up Android Auto</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/Ycxlql8fyhE?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/Ycxlql8fyhE/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Ready to use Android Auto in your Subaru Forester? Here's how to pair your Android phone and set it all up. Choose Manage Devices on the touchscreen and select Add, then open Connected Devices on your phone, pair a new device and select Forester. Confirm the PIN matches on both screens, choose whether to sync your contacts, and select Yes to enable Android Auto. From there you can access Android Auto right from the Home Screen.

Applies to model years: 2026, 2027

