   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/6PhM25vGf0I/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Emergency Lane Keeping Assist and Lane Departure Warning help keep you and your passengers safe in your Subaru Forester. Emergency Lane Keeping Assist can automatically control the steering when it detects an approaching vehicle during a lane departure, while Lane Departure Warning shows a visual alert, sounds a beep if you start to drift from your lane. This video shows you where to turn these features on in the multimedia system and when weather or road conditions may interfere with them.

