   <media:description>Ready to use Apple CarPlay in your Subaru Forester? Here's how to pair your iPhone and set it all up. Choose Manage Devices on the touchscreen and select Add, then open Bluetooth settings on your iPhone and select Forester from the device list. Confirm the PIN matches on both screens, choose whether to sync your contacts, tap Connect on your iPhone and select Yes on the touchscreen to enable CarPlay. From there you can access Apple CarPlay right from the Home Screen.

