   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/eNiR4LGAgP8/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Heading out on a chilly evening? Set the temperature to your liking with the climate controls in your Subaru Forester. Fan speed and heated seat controls are at the bottom of the touchscreen, while temperature and the windshield and rear window defrost use the physical buttons on either side of the screen. Select the Climate Control Mode Indicator to adjust temperature and airflow or to access the SYNC, AUTO and MAX A/C options. The system remembers the settings from your last drive.

Applies to model years: 2026, 2027

