   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/jWnvQyg_t9U/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Before you head out, make sure the touchscreen clock in your Subaru Forester is set correctly. There are two ways to get to the clock settings: tap the time display from almost any screen, or open the settings menu and navigate to clock. Use the arrow keys to set the time manually and touch OK to save, or choose the option to set the time automatically.

